OL,3,GNEWSAFears Digbeth faces cultural
OL,4,Awipeout if rail expansion goes ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor fans of music and arts in
OL,7,FBirmingham, Digbeth is area which
OL,8,Finspires a lot of positive feelings as
OL,9,Fthe graffiti-covered old industrial
OL,10,Fheartland that is home to the city's
OL,11,Fmain music, nightclub and art scene.
OL,13,FBut Digbeth is facing an uncertain
OL,14,Ffuture.
OL,16,FNightclubs and community venues in the
OL,17,Farea are warning that a major railway
OL,18,Fproject could lead to a "complete
OL,19,Fcultural wipe out" of the bohemian
OL,20,Fdistrict..
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
